    "baker": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老：「好孩子……麵包店又冒煙了。村子好像活過來一點了。」",
        "en": "Elder: \"Good boy... smoke is rising from the bakery again. The village feels a little more alive.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "……",
            "en": "..."
          },
          "next": "root"
        }
      ]
    },
    "tower": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老：「每一層都有收集者的爪牙。被抓的村民可能被關在任何一層——救出他們，他們就能回家。」",
        "en": "Elder: \"Every floor is full of the Collectors' beasts. The people they took could be held on any floor. Free them, and they can come home.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "……",
            "en": "..."
          },
          "next": "root"
        }
      ]
    },
    "end1": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老聽完，沉默了很久。「灰面說你是『最後的鑰匙』……里歐，你爹娘從來沒跟你提過，你是從哪裡來的吧？」",
        "en": "The elder listens, then is silent for a long time. \"Grey Mask called you 'the last key'... Leo, your parents never told you where you came from, did they?\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "「……什麼意思？」",
            "en": "\"...What do you mean?\""
          },
          "next": "end2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "end2": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老：「十二年前的冬夜，你娘抱著一個會發光的嬰兒走進村子。她說：『他會有一個平凡的童年。我保證。』」他抬頭望向高塔。「答案在塔上。你的家人也是。」",
        "en": "Elder: \"Twelve winters ago, your mother walked into the village holding a glowing baby. She said: 'He will have an ordinary childhood. I promise.'\" He looks up at the tower. \"The answers are up there. So is your family.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第一章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 1)"
          },
          "next": null,
          "action": {
            "type": "setFlag",
            "flag": "c1.done"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "c2end1": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老聽你說完凱和皮普的事，笑出聲來。「皇家騎士和貪財的小怪物？你的運氣真奇怪。」你拿出那封信。他的笑容消失了。",
        "en": "The elder laughs as you tell him about Kai and Pip. \"A royal knight and a greedy little monster? Strange luck you have.\" You show him the letter. His smile fades."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "「『L』是誰？」",
            "en": "\"Who is 'L'?\""
          },
          "next": "c2end2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "c2end2": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老：「故事裡只有一個 L——莉歐拉公主。十年前被關上塔頂的那位。如果她在給你寫信……孩子，這座塔裡的事，比我們想的還要大。」",
        "en": "Elder: \"There's only one L in the old stories: Princess Liora, locked at the top of the tower ten years ago. If she's writing to you... child, what's going on in this tower is bigger than we thought.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第二章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 2)"
          },
          "next": null,
          "action": {
            "type": "setFlag",
            "flag": "c2.done"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "c3end1": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老讀著名冊，手指停在「有記號的孩子」那一行。「……灰面以前是村裡的人？」他沉默了很久。「十二年前，有個年輕人跟你娘一起出現在村口。後來他走了，再也沒回來。」",
        "en": "The elder reads the ledger, his finger stopping at \"the marked child\". \"...Grey Mask was one of us?\" He is quiet for a long time. \"Twelve years ago a young man came to the gate with your mother. Later he left, and never came back.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "「他是誰？」",
            "en": "\"Who was he?\""
          },
          "next": "c3end2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "c3end2": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老：「我記不得他的臉了，只記得他很疼你。」他把名冊還給你。「去問學者『神裔』的事吧。你身上的光……也許就是他們要的東西。」",
        "en": "Elder: \"I can't remember his face. Only that he adored you.\" He hands the ledger back. \"Ask the scholar about the Godborn. That light of yours... may be exactly what they want.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第三章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 3)"
          },
          "next": null,
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "claimMission",
              "missionId": "m_c3_ledger"
            },
            {
              "type": "setFlag",
              "flag": "c3.done"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "c4end1": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "你說起雪夜、發光的嬰兒，還有那個下巴有疤的少年。長老的拐杖掉在地上。",
        "en": "You tell him about the snowy night, the glowing baby, and the youth with a scar on his chin. The elder's stick clatters to the floor."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "「長老？」",
            "en": "\"Elder?\""
          },
          "next": "c4end2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "c4end2": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老：「下巴有疤……布蘭。你娘的弟弟。」他的聲音在發抖。「他很疼你，里歐。可是十年前他說要去王都，就再也沒回來……」",
        "en": "Elder: \"A scar on his chin... Bran. Your mother's younger brother.\" His voice shakes. \"He adored you, Leo. Ten years ago he said he was going to the capital, and he never came back...\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第四章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 4)"
          },
          "next": null,
          "action": {
            "type": "setFlag",
            "flag": "c4.done"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "c5kill": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老沉默了很久。「……那孩子，從小就愛逞強。」他把手放在你的肩上。「你身上的光變得不一樣了，里歐。別讓它把你變成別人。」",
        "en": "The elder is silent for a long time. \"...That boy always tried to carry everything himself.\" He puts a hand on your shoulder. \"Your light has changed, Leo. Don't let it turn you into someone else.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第五章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 5)"
          },
          "next": null,
          "action": {
            "type": "setFlag",
            "flag": "c5.done"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "c5spare": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老看著廣場上一個人搬木頭的布蘭。「……村民還沒準備好原諒他。但你準備好了。」他笑了。「你娘會為你驕傲的。」",
        "en": "The elder watches Bran hauling timber alone across the square. \"...The village isn't ready to forgive him yet. But you were.\" He smiles. \"Your mother will be proud of you.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第五章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 5)"
          },
          "next": null,
          "action": {
            "type": "setFlag",
            "flag": "c5.done"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "c5just": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老點點頭。「讓國王來判吧。這不是一個孩子該背的擔子。」他看著塔頂。「去吧，去神殿。把你爹娘帶回家。」",
        "en": "The elder nods. \"Let the king judge him. That's not a burden a child should carry.\" He looks up at the top of the tower. \"Go on, to the Sanctum. Bring your parents home.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第五章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 5)"
          },
          "next": null,
          "action": {
            "type": "setFlag",
            "flag": "c5.done"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "c6end": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "長老坐在你家的門口，手裡端著一碗燉肉。「你娘硬塞給我的。」他看著塔頂。「最後一段路了，里歐。我們都在這裡等你回來吃飯。」",
        "en": "The elder sits on your doorstep, a bowl of stew in his hands. \"Your mother made me take it.\" He looks up at the top of the tower. \"This is the last stretch, Leo. We'll all be here, waiting for you to come home for dinner.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "（第六章 完）",
            "en": "(End of Chapter 6)"
          },
